1,0 $ Dextrinoid setac on pileus and stipe ABSENT; pileipellis a hymeniderm of clavate éléments, smooth, or in form of broom cells of the Rotalis- or Siccus-type $ Marasmius
1,2 $ Dextrinoid setae on pileus and stipe PRESENT; pileipellis a hymeniderm of smooth clavate elements
2,0 $ Basidiocarps collybioid or marasmioid, with central, well-developed stipe  $ Crinipellis
2,0 $ Basidiocarps reduced with latéral or lacking stipe $ Chaetocalathus……………………….
